      "content": "The number of blocks and warps residing on each multiprocessor for a given kernel call depends on the execution configuration of the call (Execution Configuration), the memory resources of the multiprocessor, and the resource requirements of the kernel as described in Hardware Multithreading. Register and shared memory usage are reported by the compiler when compiling with the --ptxas-options=-v option.",
